---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="tr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#2563eb" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>Sayfa bulunamadı · Page not found | DoctorConverter</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-bg text-text antialiased">
    <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-3xl flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16" aria-labelledby="error-title">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">404 · DoctorConverter</p>
      <h1 id="error-title" class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Bu sayfa bulunamadı.</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-text-soft">Adres değişmiş veya kaldırılmış olabilir. Ana sayfaya dönüp aradığın aracı seçebilirsin.</p>
      <nav class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3" aria-label="Ana sayfa seçenekleri">
        <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-control bg-accent px-5 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-accent-strong focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" href="/tr/">Türkçe ana sayfa</a>
        <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-control border border-border bg-surface px-5 font-semibold text-text hover:border-accent hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent" href="/">English home</a>
      </nav>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
